<title>USA: IES to file energy cost recovery proposal.</title>
<headline>IES to file energy cost recovery proposal.</headline>
<dateline>CEDAR RAPIDS, Iowa 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>IES Utilities Inc said Thursday it would file its energy-efficiency cost recovery proposal with the Iowa Utilities Board by December 15, 1996.</p>
<p>The filing seeks to recover costs incurred in 1994 and 1995 for programs that encourage energy efficiency and wise use of electricity and natural gas.</p>
<p>The IES proposal requests an overall 1.9 percent average increase for electric customers and a two percent increase for natural gas customers.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
